{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e997298c-6edf-4c7d-8994-08bc7e301a34","hash":"40a6318aab693a181efa73789cefe56101f66b930f11149dd5721538221afef2","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015QsciMMnHwCfqnPQBpNzYc","type":"tool_result","content":"=== ops\n  commits vs origin/master:\n    15bf59f 2026-11-02 Give the JusPrin v2 Standard model no thinking levels\n    40ca1bc 2026-11-02 Add the Standard model to the JusPrin v2 gateway config\n    a3f6f37 2026-10-29 Release obi.4052: Python 3.12 / Django 5.2 in staging and production\n    e08e85c 2026-10-26 Reissue tunnels.app.thespaghettidetective.com SSL certificate\n    272cde9 2026-10-25 tsdws-prod: the gateway Secret exists now\n    ad94141 2026-10-25 Release obi.4048: the JusPrin v2 model gateway in production\n    711cda1 2026-10-24 TSD stg: serve the JusPrin v2 model gateway from tsdws-stg\n    2ab4dab 2026-10-24 Elegoo prod ML: HPA minReplicas 4 -> 5 for standing GPU headroom\n    a98ab65 2026-10-21 TSD: retire staging ML API (tsdml-api-stg) and stale references\n    2031121 2026-10-21 TSD: retire own ML API; give every web_ent workload the PSC ML settings\n    3228924 2026-10-21 Release\n    8e41d87 2026-10-20 TSD prod: use Elegoo prod ML API over PSC (10.128.0.112)\n    43e5ecd 2026-10-20 PSC Terraform: TSD endpoint for Elegoo prod ML API\n    a5377a6 2026-10-20 Elegoo prod ML: publish to TSD via PSC (ServiceAttachment)\n    0f2eb6a 2026-10-20 PSC Terraform: publish object store on 3335+4335; NAT subnet for Elegoo prod ML attachment\n    681e496 2026-10-20 Elegoo prod ML: HPA minReplicas 2 -> 4 ahead of serving TSD over PSC\n    0affb3b 2026-10-20 Release elegoo\n    61c5e21 2026-10-20 Release\n    d0551a3 2026-10-20 TSD staging: call Elegoo staging ML API over PSC\n    7ec0610 2026-10-20 PSC staging Terraform, stage 2: TSD endpoint for Elegoo staging ML API\n    ee09a0f 2026-10-20 Elegoo staging ML: enable first_layer and publish to TSD via PSC\n    777a2d6 2026-10-20 Add PSC staging Terr